OL,3,GNEWSAMajor disruption as Orwell Bridge
OL,4,Ashuts after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major route in Suffolk has been
OL,7,Fclosed after a crash involving a
OL,8,Fpedestrian and a vehicle, police said.
OL,10,FThe Orwell Bridge, which carries the
OL,11,FA14 south of Ipswich, is shut in both
OL,12,Fdirections between junction 56 for
OL,13,FWherstead and junction 57 at the Nacton
OL,14,Finterchange.
OL,16,FThe accident happened on the bridge at
OL,17,F03:41 BST, and the road is likely to be
OL,18,Fclosed for several hours, Suffolk
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
